    "our-philosophy": {
      "type": "anchored-content",
      "settings": {
        "anchor": "our-philosophy",
        "eyebrow": "Our philosophy",
        "heading": "Named concentrations, or it does not go on the box",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "body": "<p>Four rules, and we would rather lose a sale than bend one.</p><ul><li>Every active is printed at the dose it is actually used at, on the carton and on the product page. A name without a number is not information.</li><li>No proprietary blends. A blend is where a token quantity of an expensive ingredient goes to hide.</li><li>No claim without its panel size and method attached. A percentage without a denominator is a decoration.</li><li>If we do not know, we say we do not know. That sentence appears more often on this site than on most.</li></ul>",
