        "body": "<p>What we will be held to, in plain terms.</p><ul><li>Every carton carries a blend date as well as an expiry. Actives lose potency long before they become unsafe, and the blend date is the more useful of the two.</li><li>Full INCI disclosure on the pack and on the product page. Nothing withheld.</li><li>Thirty days, unopened, no reason required.</li><li>If a product reacted with your skin, write to us with a photograph. We will sort it out whether or not it has been opened.</li></ul>",
